Hi <%= @household.caregiver.first_name %>,

Your household's share for <%= @payout.event.name %> is on the way: <%= number_to_currency(@payout.amount_in_dollars) %>.

<% if @payout.via_stripe? -%>
It was sent by direct deposit and should land in one to two business days.
<% else -%>
It was sent as a gift card to <%= @payout.gift_card_email %>. Look for an email from Tremendous with a link where you choose a Visa or another gift card. If it is not there, check your spam folder.
<% end -%>

You agreed to use these funds for holiday gifts for the child each list is for. If something on a list no longer fits or is no longer wanted, spend it on what that child needs. After the holidays, we will ask you for photos of what you bought and/or the receipts.

<%= @household.organization.name %>
